{% docs order_status %}
The lifecycle status of an order. One of:

| value      | meaning                                  |
|------------|------------------------------------------|
| `placed`   | Order created, payment not yet captured  |
| `shipped`  | Order dispatched to the customer         |
| `returned` | Order returned and refunded              |

See the [order lifecycle runbook](https://wiki.internal/orders) for edge cases.
{% enddocs %}

